              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyejo jwasangalele mnope, nipo ŵalamwile kuti Daniele amkoposye mwisimbomo. Myoyo ŵamkopwesye Daniele ali jwangapwetecedwa amta panandi, pakuti jwalakwejo jwakulupilile Mlungu jwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo mwenye jwalamwile kuti akakamule ŵandu uŵasisyaga ya Daniele ŵala ni kwaponya mwisimbo lya masimba lila, jemanjajo pamo ni aciŵamkwawo ni ŵanace ŵawo wosope. Ali ŵaponyisye mwisimbomo, mkanayice pasi kose, masimba gasumbile mwinani ni kwakasanya mawupa gawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
